{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他忽然松下来，感到安静、温柔而郑重。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M7\", \"M13\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S05让他发现，反复加力不能替对方确认回应，持续紧绷只会耗掉自己。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M7\", \"M13\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他不再只盯着对方是否理解自己，开始感到对方本身的可贵与亲近。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M17\", \"M28\", \"M30\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"急于被理解的力气已经耗尽，他才有余地把注意力从自己的委屈移开。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M21\", \"M28\", \"M54\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"想到对方时，亲近渐渐充实，温柔里也浮出不舍，心里一瞬空落。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\", \"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M33\", \"M38\", \"M45\", \"M52\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S01让他知道亲近不能使过去复原；S05又让他看清，强求不能换来对方的回应。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\", \"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M29\", \"M46\", \"M52\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，暂时不追问对方是否理解，仍能真切感到对方本身的亲近；但这份亲近不能让过去重来，也不能替对方作答。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "55cfe8e3-83ca-4459-9c22-de6627e784e7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T234543859707Z", "elapsed_seconds": 120.235, "completed_ut